% CRAB KEY (dr_no) references.
%
% Every entry below is a real, checkable source for a model actually implemented
% in src/dr_no/. Entries are deliberately conservative: where a DOI could not be
% confirmed it is omitted rather than guessed, and two earlier entries were
% removed outright rather than shipped unverified —
%   * "Kennedy, Strenge & Pauley (2011), DCAL and the RADTRAN Family of Codes"
%     conflated two unrelated code families under an unconfirmed title; the
%     inhalation dose coefficients it was cited for are covered by icrp119
%     and icrp72 below.
%   * "Martin, J. A. & Green, D. A. (1976), Dispersion and Dosimetry Models"
%     appears to be a garbled attribution; the power-law Pasquill-Gifford fit
%     the plume model actually uses is martin1976comment (D. O. Martin, JAPCA).

